  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ham shank arrives at the table like a cherished family friend, slow-cooked in a fragrant broth of apple cider with honey-glazed root vegetables and bright citrus teasing the senses. Imagine crackling aromas drifting through the room while you settle into the comfort of creamy mashed potatoes and green beans kissed with garlic-infused olive oil. Each tender bite balances savory depth and gentle sweetness, with thyme and rosemary threading through the meat like a quiet lullaby. Perfect for cozy gatherings, this comforting centerpiece invites laughter, easy conversation, and memories seasoned with pure joy.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-ham-shank\">Why You’ll Love This ham shank</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-ham-shank\">How to Make ham shank</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-ham-shank\">Pro Tips for Making ham shank</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-ham-shank\">How to Serve this ham </a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-ham-shank\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This ham shank</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Rich, savory flavor that warms your heart.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly tender texture that melts in your mouth.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for any occasion, from casual dinners to festive feasts.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to prepare, making you the star of the kitchen.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for leftovers, adding deliciousness to future meals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7064\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7064\" data-